@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

flowchart LR
	User([Batter/User])
	Camera([Camera Device])
	MediaPipe([MediaPipe Runtime])
	D1[(D1 ShotBenchmarks)]
	D2[(D2 AnalysisSessions)]
	D3[(D3 SessionAnomalies)]
	Backend[[FastAPI Backend\nOptional Path]]
	System[[StanceAI System]]

	User -->|control actions\nstart/stop/upload/select| System
	Camera -->|live frames| System
	System -->|overlay + metrics + summary| User
	System -->|frame inference request| MediaPipe
	MediaPipe -->|landmarks| System
	System <--> |benchmark read| D1
	System <--> |session create/update| D2
	System <--> |anomaly insert/query| D3
	System -.->|optional websocket frame stream| Backend
	Backend -.->|optional analyzed response| System

	subgraph L1[DFD Level 1 - StanceAI Detailed Flow]
		P1[P1 Input Capture]
		P2[P2 Pose Inference]
		P3[P3 Biomechanics Computation]
		P4[P4 Benchmark Retrieval]
		P5[P5 Session Lifecycle Persistence]
		P6[P6 Anomaly Persistence]
		P7[P7 Visualization and Feedback]
		PB[P2B/P3B Backend Analyze Path\nOptional]

		User -->|start/stop/upload/select shot type| P1
		Camera -->|video stream / frame| P1
		P1 -->|current frame| P2
		P2 -->|inference call| MediaPipe
		MediaPipe -->|landmarks (33)| P2
		P2 -->|landmarks + shot_type| P3
		P3 -->|joint angles + quality + deviation| P7
		P4 <--> |read benchmark set by shot_type| D1
		P4 -->|benchmark thresholds| P3
		P1 -->|session start signal| P5
		P5 <--> |create/update session stats| D2
		P3 -->|flagged joint events| P6
		P6 <--> |insert/query anomalies| D3
		P7 -->|skeleton overlay + labels + summary| User
		P2 -.->|optional frame stream| PB
		PB -.->|optional server-side analyzed result| P7
	end

	%% Use when backend websocket processing is enabled.